LOCATION:Mic Drop Comedy Chandler\, 51 E. Boston St.\, Chandler
DESCRIPTION:Come have some mid-week eats\, drinks\, and laughs with us at 7
 pm every\nThursday at Mic Drop Comedy Chandler. Join us in Downtown Chandle
 r as we share\nthe best talent that the phoenix comedy scene has to offer. 
 Laugh the\nnight away with our booking scouts as we look for Arizona's next
  David\nSpade... Who knows\, you might be witness to their big break! Hoste
 d by\nMic Drop favorite Anthony Thornton.\n\nDoors open at 6pm. We have ple
 nty of food and drink specials but don't force you to purchase anything - N
 O DRINK MINIMUMS!\n\nThis one is for the culture\, Phoenix.\n\nFree\nentry 
 for all comics and signups will begin at 6pm. Set lengths are 4\nmins and p
 ulled bucket style. The show will end promptly at 10pm.\n\nAges 17+\n\nFee 
 applies if transferring confirmed ticket purchase to another guest.\n\nDoor
 s for open for seating approximately 30 minutes before late showtimes. Plea
 se note\, doors are subject to prior show endtime and may change without no
 tice\, beyond our control.\n\nNo refunds or exchanges.\n\nTicket resale is 
 strictly prohibited. Any tickets purchased or listed on a third-party resal
 e website or platform is a direct violation of our Venue Policies and will 
 not be honored\, resulting in denied admission. Third party resale websites
  and platforms include but are not limited to StubHub\, Vivid Seats\, Seat 
 Geek\, eTickets\, Event Tickets Center\, GoTickets\, Craigslist\, OfferUp\,
  Facebook Marketplace\, etc.\n\nWaitlists are available for sold out shows.
  To join the Waitlist\, you must be present at the venue prior to showtime 
 on the day of the event. You will need to provide your name and how many ti
 ckets you'd like to purchase. About 10-15 minutes after the show starts\, w
 e will go through our showroom and find the empty seats available and sell 
 tickets in order of arrival.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atl
 as/event/once-upon-a-mic-37427/
